<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Method ‣ Spontaneous High-Order Generalization in Neural Theory-of-Mind Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Model and Implementation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
