</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
          append <math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math> to <span id="algorithm2.4.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">parents[<math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>v</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math>]</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">11</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm2.4.13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">// The topological order <math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000">π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the order in which characters exit the scene. During each traversal, the current node first enters the scene, and all of its parent nodes must also be ensured to enter simultaneously</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm2.4.14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">character_order</span> <math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> empty list;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm2.4.15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">scene_node</span> <math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> empty list;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
